<title>NETHERLANDS: Esso Rotterdam flexi-coker restarted at weekend.</title>
<headline>Esso Rotterdam flexi-coker restarted at weekend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The flexi-coker at Exxon Corp's Esso Netherlands Rotterdam refinery restarted over the weekend, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's running...(having restarted) some time this weekend,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>A power outage in the Rotterdam area in mid-December caused the closure of the entire 175,000 barrel per day refinery, but, apart from the flexi-coker, all other units were back in operation within 10 days.</p>
<p>The flexi-coker's closure made the company a seller of high sulphur fuel oil in the ARA barge market.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
